# SITL fault injection: thrusters 2 (front-left) and 3 (back-right) produce no thrust.
# The mixer still drives them, as on the real vehicle with failed motors.
# SERVOx_FUNCTION 0 does NOT work in ArduSub (the frame setup re-assigns motor 2/3 to an
# unassigned channel) and 1 (RCPassThru) copies RC input, e.g. the throttle override.
# 135 (k_trim) holds the output at SERVOx_TRIM = 1500 us, i.e. zero thrust.
# Use: main_launch.launch.py extra_sitl_params:=<this file>
SERVO2_FUNCTION 135
SERVO2_TRIM 1500
SERVO3_FUNCTION 135
SERVO3_TRIM 1500
